<%- include("partials/header", { title: "OrganizaPay | Trazer fatura" }) %>

<%
  const now = new Date();
  const currentMonth = now.getMonth() + 1;
  const currentYear = now.getFullYear();
  const monthNames = [
    'Janeiro', 'Fevereiro', 'Março', 'Abril', 'Maio', 'Junho',
    'Julho', 'Agosto', 'Setembro', 'Outubro', 'Novembro', 'Dezembro'
  ];
  const selectedMonth = Number(formSeed?.month || currentMonth);
  const selectedYear = Number(formSeed?.year || currentYear);
  const selectedCardId = Number(formSeed?.cardId || 0);
  const brl = new Intl.NumberFormat('pt-BR', { style: 'currency', currency: 'BRL' });
  const years = [];
  for (let year = currentYear - 1; year <= currentYear + 3; year += 1) years.push(year);
%>

<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-6 pb-24">
  <section class="op-page-hero op-fade-up">
    <div>
      <span class="op-page-hero__eyebrow">Trazer fatura pro app</span>
      <h1 class="op-page-hero__title mt-4">Importar fatura em CSV</h1>
      <p class="op-page-hero__subtitle mt-3">Envie o CSV do cartão e diga em qual mês essa fatura deve cair por aqui.</p>
      <div class="op-page-hero__meta mt-4">
        <span class="badge"><%= cards.length %> cartão(ões) disponível(is)</span>
        <span class="badge">Disponível conforme sua permissão</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <% if (error) { %>
    <div class="op-inline-alert op-inline-alert--danger">
      <div class="op-inline-alert__icon">⚠️</div>
      <div>
        <div class="op-inline-alert__title">Não foi possível importar o arquivo</div>
        <div class="op-inline-alert__text"><%= error %></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <% if (importReport) { %>
    <section class="op-surface-card rounded-[32px] border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50/80 p-6 shadow-soft dark:border-blue-900/60 dark:bg-blue-950/20">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 xl:flex-row xl:items-start xl:justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/90 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue-700 shadow-sm dark:bg-slate-900/70 dark:text-blue-200">Pente-fino da última importação</div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Algumas linhas ficaram de fora por prudência</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Em <strong><%= importReport.periodLabel %></strong>, o app comparou quantas compras iguais já existiam e quantas vieram no CSV. O que passou da conta entrou. O que bateu certinho com o que já estava por aqui ficou listado abaixo para você decidir se era repeteco mesmo ou se vale lançar manualmente.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="badge"><%= importReport.importedCount %> <%= importReport.importedCount === 1 ? 'compra entrou' : 'compras entraram' %></span>
            <span class="inline-flex min-h-[32px] items-center rounded-full border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black text-amber-700 shadow-sm dark:border-amber-900/60 dark:bg-amber-950/30 dark:text-amber-200"><%= importReport.skippedExistingCount %> <%= importReport.skippedExistingCount === 1 ? 'linha ficou de fora' : 'linhas ficaram de fora' %></span>
            <% if (importReport.repeatedCsvGroupCount > 0) { %>
              <span class="inline-flex min-h-[32px] items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black text-blue-700 shadow-sm dark:border-blue-900/60 dark:bg-blue-950/30 dark:text-blue-200"><%= importReport.repeatedCsvGroupCount %> <%= importReport.repeatedCsvGroupCount === 1 ? 'grupo idêntico apareceu no CSV' : 'grupos idênticos apareceram no CSV' %></span>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row xl:flex-col xl:items-stretch">
          <a href="<%= importReport.targetHref %>" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-blue-700">Abrir o mês importado</a>
          <a href="/import" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 transition hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800">Trazer outro CSV</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 overflow-hidden rounded-[26px] border border-blue-100 bg-white/90 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/80">
        <div class="border-b border-blue-100 px-5 py-4 dark:border-slate-800">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Linhas que ficaram de fora</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Nada aqui foi chamado de erro com martelo. É só a lista do que o app segurou porque já encontrou a mesma combinação na mesma quantidade.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800">
          <% importReport.skippedExistingGroups.forEach((item) => { %>
            <div class="grid gap-3 px-5 py-4 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] md:items-start">
              <div class="space-y-2">
                <div class="text-sm font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100"><%= item.description %></div>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                  <span><%= item.txnDate ? formatDateBR(item.txnDate) : 'Sem data legível' %></span>
                  <% if (item.cardNumber) { %><span>Final <%= item.cardNumber %></span><% } %>
                  <span><%= item.count %> <%= item.count === 1 ? 'linha segurada' : 'linhas seguradas' %></span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2 md:items-end">
                <div class="text-sm font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100"><%= brl.format(Number(item.amountCents || 0) / 100) %></div>
                <div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-amber-700 dark:bg-amber-900/30 dark:text-amber-200">Já havia <%= item.existingCount %> igual<%= item.existingCount === 1 ? '' : 'is' %> por aqui</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          <% }) %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <% if (importReport.repeatedCsvGroupCount > 0) { %>
        <div class="mt-4 rounded-[24px] border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 px-5 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70 dark:text-slate-300">
          <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Olhar esperto</div>
          <p class="mt-2 leading-6">O CSV também trouxe <strong><%= importReport.repeatedCsvGroupCount %></strong> <%= importReport.repeatedCsvGroupCount === 1 ? 'grupo de linhas idênticas' : 'grupos de linhas idênticas' %>. Eu não travei isso sozinho porque pode ser compra legítima — tipo Uber ida e volta, estacionamento repetido ou cafezinho no mesmo valor.</p>
        </div>
      <% } %>
    </section>
  <% } %>

  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.15fr)_minmax(300px,0.85fr)]">
    <section class="op-surface-card rounded-[32px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-soft dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
      <div class="mb-5">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Trazer nova fatura</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Escolha o cartão, diga em qual mês ela entra e envie o CSV original da operadora.</p>
      </div>

      <form method="post" action="/import" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="space-y-5">
        <div>
          <label class="mb-1.5 block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Cartão</label>
          <select name="card_id" required class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 outline-none transition focus:border-blue-400 focus:bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:focus:bg-slate-950">
            <option value="">Selecione um cartão</option>
            <% cards.forEach(card => { %>
              <option value="<%= card.id %>" <%= card.id === selectedCardId ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= card.name %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <label class="mb-1.5 block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Vai entrar em qual mês?</label>
            <select name="month" required class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 outline-none transition focus:border-blue-400 focus:bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:focus:bg-slate-950">
              <% monthNames.forEach((label, index) => { %>
                <option value="<%= index + 1 %>" <%= (index + 1) === selectedMonth ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= label %></option>
              <% }) %>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="mb-1.5 block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Ano</label>
            <select name="year" required class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 outline-none transition focus:border-blue-400 focus:bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 dark:focus:bg-slate-950">
              <% years.forEach(year => { %>
                <option value="<%= year %>" <%= year === selectedYear ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= year %></option>
              <% }) %>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Arquivo CSV</label>
            <a href="/examples/card_csv_example.csv" download="card_csv_example.csv" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 transition hover:bg-blue-100 dark:border-blue-800 dark:bg-blue-950/30 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:bg-blue-950/50">
              Baixar exemplo
            </a>
          </div>
          <label class="flex cursor-pointer flex-col gap-3 rounded-[28px] border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-slate-50/80 px-5 py-5 transition hover:border-blue-300 hover:bg-blue-50/60 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/50 dark:hover:border-blue-500 dark:hover:bg-blue-950/20">
            <span class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white text-slate-500 shadow-sm dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300">
              <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 16a4 4 0 01-.88-7.903A5 5 0 1115.9 6L16 6a5 5 0 011 9.9M15 13l-3-3m0 0l-3 3m3-3v12"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="block text-sm font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Escolher CSV</span>
              <span class="mt-1 block text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Use o arquivo exportado da operadora do cartão. Formatos aceitos: .csv</span>
            </span>
            <input type="file" name="csvfile" accept=".csv,text/csv" required class="sr-only">
          </label>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">O exemplo ajuda a conferir o formato antes de enviar o arquivo real.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 pt-2 sm:flex-row">
          <button type="submit" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-emerald-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-emerald-700">
            Trazer fatura
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>

    <aside class="space-y-4">
      <section class="op-surface-card rounded-[32px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-soft dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Antes de importar</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-xs font-black text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/40 dark:text-blue-200">1</span><span>Confirme se o CSV pertence ao cartão escolhido.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-xs font-black text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/40 dark:text-blue-200">2</span><span>Escolha o mês em que essa fatura deve entrar no app.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-xs font-black text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/40 dark:text-blue-200">3</span><span>Se precisar, baixe o <strong>CSV modelo</strong> para conferir a estrutura esperada antes de enviar o arquivo real.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-xs font-black text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/40 dark:text-blue-200">4</span><span>O app compara a quantidade de compras iguais que já existem com a quantidade que veio no CSV. Se vier uma igual a mais, ela entra. Se bater certinho com o que já existe, fica de fora e aparece listada para você conferir.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-xs font-black text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/40 dark:text-blue-200">5</span><span>Depois da importação, revise as compras do mês para distribuir e ajustar participantes.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/90 p-5 text-sm font-medium text-amber-900 shadow-sm dark:border-amber-900/70 dark:bg-amber-950/30 dark:text-amber-100">
        <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300">Importante</div>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-6">Se o arquivo voltar para a pista, o app compara quantas linhas iguais já estão no mês. Assim ele evita repeteco sem barrar corrida de ida e volta, compra gêmea ou qualquer coincidência legítima. Quando segurar algo, ele te mostra a lista com carinho.</p>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>
